@startuml 06-kafka-event-flow
title Kafka event flow - topic claim-lifecycle-events
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
left to right direction

component "care-claims-service\nClaimEventPublisher port\nKafkaClaimEventPublisher adapter" as prod
queue "claim-lifecycle-events\n3 partitions\nkey = claimReference\nvalue = JSON envelope" as topic
component "care-notification-service\nClaimEventListener\ngroup care-notification-group" as cons
file "Audit log line\n[AUDIT NOTIFICATION] ..." as log

prod --> topic : CLAIM_SUBMITTED\n(always)
prod --> topic : CLAIM_ADJUDICATED\n(only if APPROVED or DENIED)
prod ..> topic : CLAIM_REVERSED\n(contract defined, not produced yet)
topic --> cons : consume\nat-least-once
cons --> log : APPROVED / DENIED -> payable amount\nREVERSED -> prior payable amount

note bottom of topic
  Envelope: eventId (uuid), eventType, timestamp, payload.
  Money fields are strings to keep scale-2 precision.
  UNDER_REVIEW claims emit CLAIM_SUBMITTED only.
end note
@enduml
